// Replication between daemons (docs/collab.md). Daemons sharing a project
// exchange its assertion log, and nothing else: derived facts are
// recomputed by each daemon from the same inputs. Ops carry global ids, so
// a daemon summarises what it holds as a version vector and asks a peer
// for the rest (anti-entropy), then keeps a live stream open.
//
// The service is unauthenticated. Serve it on loopback or a trusted
// network only; a peer can write anything any user could.

